cation (pinch) gesture drives an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state feeds the shape’s Transform Scale ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"builtin.point3D"},{"type":"text","text":"); releasing the pinch “pops” the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"switch to its nearest state with a spring. At rest a white triangle sits at its base scale on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the magenta artboard."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","type":"topic","title":"Swami"}}}